@startuml
title OC-D07 Supervisor Review, Evidence, and Audit Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor Supervisor
participant "Operator Console UI" as UI
participant "RBAC / Privacy Policy" as Policy
participant "Central PMS /\nDiscount Workflow" as Workflow
participant "Evidence Service /\nEvidence Repository" as Evidence
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Supervisor -> UI : Open review queue
UI -> Policy : Check role, Site scope,\ndevice, shift, and evidence permission

alt access denied
  Policy --> UI : Deny
  UI -> Audit : Record review/evidence access denial
  UI --> Supervisor : Access denied
else access allowed
  Policy --> UI : Allow scoped review
  UI -> Workflow : Load assigned-scope discount case
  Workflow --> UI : Case details and status
  UI -> Evidence : Request evidence reference/view\nif policy allows
  Evidence -> Policy : Re-check evidence access
  Policy --> Evidence : Allow / redact / deny
  Evidence --> UI : Evidence reference or redacted view
  UI -> Audit : Record evidence access
  Supervisor -> UI : Approve / reject / override\nwith reason and justification
  UI -> Workflow : Submit reason-coded decision
  Workflow --> UI : Decision recorded
  UI -> Audit : Record supervisor decision
  UI --> Supervisor : Display final review status
end

note bottom
Supervisor override is audited.
It does not mutate payment finality,
issue ExitAuthorization, open gates,
or issue fiscal documents.
end note

@enduml
